{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"Nim 内存管理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/fundamentals/memory-management","wordCount":1200,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-内存管理模型\">Nim 内存管理模型</h1><p>Nim 2.x 的默认内存管理策略是 ORC——一种基于引用计数的确定性内存管理方案，通过「试删除」算法处理循环引用。这既不是传统的 tracing GC（没有 stop-the-world 暂停），也不是纯手动管理（无需显式 free）。开发者通过生命周期钩子（<code>=destroy</code>、<code>=copy</code>、<code>=sink</code>）精确控制资源语义，编译器则通过移动语义优化减少不必要的拷贝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ORC</strong>：默认策略，引用计数 + 试删除循环收集，无 STW 暂停，共享堆</li>\n<li><strong>ARC</strong>：ORC 减去循环收集器，适合确知无循环的场景（更小代码体积）</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期钩子</strong>：6 种编译器隐式调用的类型绑定操作符（<code>=destroy</code>/<code>=copy</code>/<code>=sink</code>/<code>=trace</code>/<code>=dup</code>/<code>=wasMoved</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>sink/lent 语义</strong>：sink 转移所有权避免拷贝，lent 只读借用避免 RC 递增</li>\n<li><strong>acyclic 注解</strong>：对确知无环的 ref object 跳过循环追踪，减少运行时开销</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多策略内存管理概览\">多策略内存管理概览</h2><p>Nim 通过编译器开关 <code>--mm:</code> 选择内存管理模式。不同模式适用于不同场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>堆模型</th>\n<th>循环处理</th>\n<th>原子操作</th>\n<th>STW 暂停</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ORC（默认）</td>\n<td>共享堆</td>\n<td>循环收集器</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>通用场景、异步代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARC</td>\n<td>共享堆</td>\n<td>泄漏</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无循环场景、嵌入式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Atomic ARC</td>\n<td>共享堆</td>\n<td>泄漏</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>多线程共享对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RefC</td>\n<td>线程局部堆</td>\n<td>循环收集器</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>旧代码兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>None</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>裸机/极限控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ORC 的引用计数操作<strong>不使用原子指令</strong>——子图整体在线程间移动而非逐指针共享。编译器通过 <code>--expandArc:funcName</code> 可以查看对特定函数做了哪些 RC 优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"arc-与-orc-的核心机制\">ARC 与 ORC 的核心机制</h2><p>ARC（Automatic Reference Counting）是基础层：每个堆对象维护一个引用计数，对象离开作用域时计数递减至零则析构。ORC 在 ARC 之上叠加了循环收集器，使用 Lins 的「试删除」（trial deletion）算法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[对象分配] --&gt; B[引用计数追踪]&#10;    B --&gt; C{计数归零?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[调用 =destroy]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E{可能在循环中?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[加入候选集]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[继续运行]&#10;    F --&gt; H[试删除扫描]&#10;    H --&gt; I{确认为垃圾?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| D&#10;    I --&gt;|否| G&#10;    D --&gt; J[释放内存]\">graph LR\n    A[对象分配] --&gt; B[引用计数追踪]\n    B --&gt; C{计数归零?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[调用 =destroy]\n    C --&gt;|否| E{可能在循环中?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[加入候选集]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[继续运行]\n    F --&gt; H[试删除扫描]\n    H --&gt; I{确认为垃圾?}\n    I --&gt;|是| D\n    I --&gt;|否| G\n    D --&gt; J[释放内存]</pre><p>关键设计决策：ORC 的循环收集器<strong>仅扫描可能参与循环的类型</strong>（含 <code>ref</code> 字段的对象）。编译器在编译期分析类型图，对不可能形成循环的类型直接跳过收集检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type&#10;  # 编译器知道 Leaf 不含 ref —— 纯 ARC 路径，无循环检查开销&#10;  Leaf = object&#10;    value: int&#10;    name: string&#10;&#10;  # TreeNode 含自引用 ref —— 进入 ORC 路径&#10;  TreeNode = ref object&#10;    data: int&#10;    children: seq[TreeNode]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 编译器知道 Leaf 不含 ref —— 纯 ARC 路径，无循环检查开销</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Leaf = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # TreeNode 含自引用 ref —— 进入 ORC 路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  TreeNode = ref object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    children: seq[TreeNode]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生命周期钩子-lifetime-tracking-hooks\">生命周期钩子（Lifetime-tracking Hooks）</h2><p>Nim 为每个（泛型或具体的）对象类型 T 提供 6 种由编译器隐式调用的钩子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type&#10;  Buffer[T] = object&#10;    len, cap: int&#10;    data: ptr UncheckedArray[T]&#10;&#10;proc `=destroy`[T](buf: Buffer[T]) =&#10;  ## 作用域结束时调用；释放资源&#10;  if buf.data != nil:&#10;    for i in 0..&lt;buf.len:&#10;      `=destroy`(buf.data[i])&#10;    dealloc(buf.data)&#10;&#10;proc `=copy`[T](dst: var Buffer[T], src: Buffer[T]) =&#10;  ## 赋值时调用（深拷贝语义）&#10;  if dst.data == src.data: return&#10;  `=destroy`(dst)&#10;  dst.len = src.len&#10;  dst.cap = src.cap&#10;  if src.data != nil:&#10;    dst.data = cast[ptr UncheckedArray[T]](alloc(dst.cap * sizeof(T)))&#10;    for i in 0..&lt;dst.len:&#10;      dst.data[i] = src.data[i]&#10;&#10;proc `=sink`[T](dst: var Buffer[T], src: Buffer[T]) =&#10;  ## 移动赋值时调用（窃取资源）&#10;  `=destroy`(dst)&#10;  dst.len = src.len&#10;  dst.cap = src.cap&#10;  dst.data = src.data&#10;&#10;proc `=trace`[T](buf: var Buffer[T]; env: pointer) =&#10;  ## ORC 循环收集器用来遍历对象图&#10;  if buf.data != nil:&#10;    for i in 0..&lt;buf.len:&#10;      `=trace`(buf.data[i], env)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Buffer[T] = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    len, cap: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: ptr UncheckedArray[T]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc `=destroy`[T](buf: Buffer[T]) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 作用域结束时调用；释放资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if buf.data != nil:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..&#x3C;buf.len:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      `=destroy`(buf.data[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dealloc(buf.data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc `=copy`[T](dst: var Buffer[T], src: Buffer[T]) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 赋值时调用（深拷贝语义）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if dst.data == src.data: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  `=destroy`(dst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dst.len = src.len</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dst.cap = src.cap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if src.data != nil:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dst.data = cast[ptr UncheckedArray[T]](alloc(dst.cap * sizeof(T)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..&#x3C;dst.len:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      dst.data[i] = src.data[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc `=sink`[T](dst: var Buffer[T], src: Buffer[T]) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 移动赋值时调用（窃取资源）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  `=destroy`(dst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dst.len = src.len</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dst.cap = src.cap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dst.data = src.data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc `=trace`[T](buf: var Buffer[T]; env: pointer) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## ORC 循环收集器用来遍历对象图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if buf.data != nil:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..&#x3C;buf.len:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      `=trace`(buf.data[i], env)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>钩子</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>默认行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>=destroy</code></td>\n<td>变量离开作用域 / 显式 reset</td>\n<td>递归销毁子字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>=copy</code></td>\n<td>赋值（非 sink 上下文）</td>\n<td>逐字段深拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>=dup</code></td>\n<td>从不可变源拷贝构造</td>\n<td><code>=wasMoved</code> + <code>=copy</code> 的优化组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>=sink</code></td>\n<td>移动赋值（编译器检测到最后一次使用）</td>\n<td><code>=destroy</code> + <code>copyMem</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>=wasMoved</code></td>\n<td>sink 后将源置为安全状态</td>\n<td>将关键字段置 nil/零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>=trace</code></td>\n<td>ORC 循环收集扫描</td>\n<td>递归追踪 ref 字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"所有权转移-sink-与-lent\">所有权转移：sink 与 lent</h2><p>Nim 用 <code>sink</code> 和 <code>lent</code> 注解参数的所有权语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"proc consume(data: sink string) =&#10;  ## sink：调用者放弃所有权，data 在此函数内部被消耗&#10;  echo &quot;Consumed: &quot;, data&#10;  # data 在函数结束时被 =destroy&#10;&#10;proc borrow(data: lent string) =&#10;  ## lent：只读借用，不增加引用计数&#10;  echo &quot;Borrowed: &quot;, data&#10;  # 不触发 =copy，也不触发 =destroy&#10;&#10;proc process() =&#10;  var msg = &quot;Hello, ownership!&quot;&#10;  borrow(msg)   # msg 仍然有效&#10;  consume(msg)  # msg 的所有权转移——之后不可再使用 msg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>proc consume(data: sink string) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## sink：调用者放弃所有权，data 在此函数内部被消耗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Consumed: \", data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # data 在函数结束时被 =destroy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc borrow(data: lent string) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## lent：只读借用，不增加引用计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Borrowed: \", data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 不触发 =copy，也不触发 =destroy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc process() =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var msg = \"Hello, ownership!\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  borrow(msg)   # msg 仍然有效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  consume(msg)  # msg 的所有权转移——之后不可再使用 msg</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器在语义分析阶段执行移动分析：当检测到变量在某处最后一次使用（last use）时，自动将赋值转为 <code>=sink</code> 而非 <code>=copy</code>。这种优化是透明的——开发者写出自然的赋值代码，编译器决定拷贝还是移动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"使用-acyclic-注解避免循环开销\">使用 acyclic 注解避免循环开销</h2><p>对于确知不会形成循环的 <code>ref object</code>，可以用 <code>{.acyclic.}</code> 注解跳过 ORC 的循环追踪：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type&#10;  # 链表节点：单向，不可能成环&#10;  ListNode {.acyclic.} = ref object&#10;    value: int&#10;    next: ListNode&#10;&#10;proc newList(values: varargs[int]): ListNode =&#10;  for i in countdown(values.high, 0):&#10;    result = ListNode(value: values[i], next: result)&#10;&#10;# ORC 不会对 ListNode 执行试删除——纯引用计数路径&#10;let list = newList(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 链表节点：单向，不可能成环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ListNode {.acyclic.} = ref object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next: ListNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc newList(values: varargs[int]): ListNode =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i in countdown(values.high, 0):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = ListNode(value: values[i], next: result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># ORC 不会对 ListNode 执行试删除——纯引用计数路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let list = newList(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这在性能敏感路径上可以显著减少 ORC 的元数据开销和扫描频率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其他语言的内存模型对比\">与其他语言的内存模型对比</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ORC 总开销</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>引用计数操作</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>循环扫描</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>编译器消除的 RC 操作</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ORC 总开销} = \\underbrace{N_{alloc} \\cdot C_{rc}}_{\\text{引用计数操作}} + \\underbrace{N_{cycle} \\cdot C_{scan}}_{\\text{循环扫描}} - \\underbrace{N_{elide} \\cdot C_{rc}}_{\\text{编译器消除的 RC 操作}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ORC </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总开销</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">引用计数操作</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" 